(text "Display header (pin order per LCDWiki ST7796 3.5in module) - VERIFY on the bought module:\n1 VCC 5 V (~0.5 W)   2 GND   3 CS   4 RST   5 RS/DC   6 SDI   7 SCK   8 LED\n9 SDO, 10-13 touch, 14 SD_CS: not used (SDO left open so the module never drives MISO).\nLED = backlight control input (95 mA backlight is switched on the module) -> driven from DISP_BL;\nthe 0R on the MCU sheet is the fallback if a module needs a transistor here." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 96.52 93.98 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b9aa7977-9195-4f69-9bb6-e680931be45f"))
